# Every variable a run reads, with no value for any of them. Copy to `.env`
# and fill it in; `.gitignore` covers `.env*` and excepts this file alone.
#
# A key that has been exposed is rotated at its source — nothing in this
# repository can undo that for it.

# The STRATZ statistics API token. A run with this unset or empty fails before
# its first request. Issued at https://stratz.com/api.
STRATZ_API_KEY=
